RELATIONAL  OPERATOR: 
 Relational operator is otherwise known as comarison operator which is used to compare two values
 It accepts only numbers and characters 
 Datatype should be boolean
 Don't use strings to compare

TYPES OF RELATIONAL OPERATOR
<   --> Greater Than
<=  --> Greater than or equal to 
>   --> Less than
>=  --> Less than or equal to 
==  --> Equal to
!=  --> Not equal to 


